{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49503","headline":"临江仙 二 · 顾敻","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽闺小槛春光晚，柳浓花澹莺稀。\n旧欢思想尚依依。\n翠嚬红歛，终日损芳菲。\n何事狂夫音信断，不如梁燕犹归。\n画堂深处麝烟微。\n屏虚枕冷，风细雨霏霏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}